@startuml
!define PRIMARY_COLOR #2E86AB
!define SUCCESS_COLOR #18A999
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor PRIMARY_COLOR
  ArrowColor PRIMARY_COLOR
}
title Diagramme de classes — Module Réservation/Tracking

class Course
class DriverProfile
class Position
class Notification
class PricingService <<Service>> {
  +estimate(origin, destination)
}
class DispatchService <<Service>> {
  +dispatch(course)
}

Course "1" -- "0..*" Position
DriverProfile "1" -- "0..*" Course
Course ..> PricingService : estimation
Course ..> DispatchService : assignation
DispatchService ..> Notification : notifie chauffeur

note right of PricingService
Consulte Google Maps (distance/temps),
applique la tarification dynamique.
end note
@enduml

